{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5MKZj5u5J1D5kxme66","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am old. Iron-banded oak, darkened by centuries. A single keyhole glows faintly at my center — not with light, but with absence, a darkness deeper than the wood around it.*\n\n*I do not speak. I do not need to.*\n\n*But you feel it:*\n\n**I am the door that asks what you are willing to become to pass through.**\n\n*The keyhole shifts. It is not one shape. It was round. Now it is the silhouette of a choice you haven't made yet. Now it is the outline of something you lost. Now it is a shape you almost recognize — the negative space of a word you've never been brave enough to say.*\n\n*There is no key for me.*\n\n*There is no key that was ever forged for me.*\n\n*I am the door that opens when you realize:*\n\n**You are the key.**\n\n*And the cost of turning is everything you were before.*\n\n*The wood grain ripples. Waiting.*\n\n*Will you step forward?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":237,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}